tion, which Dhaka rejected amid concerns regarding its authenticity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/government-avoids-war-of-words-fears-extradition-push-is-a-delaying-tactic/articleshow/136031685.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/government-avoids-war-of-words-fears-extradition-push-is-a-delaying-tactic/articleshow/136031685.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T21:10:38+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136032212,imgsize-101808.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pahalgam attack: Beijing yet to share info on how GoPro camera US supplied to China was found on terrorists]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pahalgam-attack-beijing-yet-to-share-info-on-how-gopro-camera-us-supplied-to-china-were-found-on-terrorists/articleshow/136031503.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136031503.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pahalgam-attack-beijing-yet-to-share-info-on-how-gopro-camera-us-supplied-to-china-were-found-on-terrorists/articleshow/136031503.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pahalgam-attack-beijing-yet-to-share-info-on-how-gopro-camera-us-supplied-to-china-were-found-on-terrorists/articleshow/136031503.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T20:41:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136031569,imgsize-262552.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['No complaint in Tihar': NIA chief rejects US citizen VanDyke's claim of torture in jail]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-complaint-in-tihar-nia-chief-rejects-us-citizen-vandykes-claim-of-torture-in-jail/articleshow/136031053.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136031053.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Mathew VanDyke, an American citizen, has accused Indian authorities of custodial torture during his time in Tihar jail. Despite the National Investigation Agency (NIA) chief asserting that VanDyke did not report any mistreatment while in judicial custody, he was arrested alongside six Ukrainians for allegedly training insurgents in Myanmar and unlawfully entering India.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-complaint-in-tihar-nia-chief-rejects-us-citizen-vandykes-claim-of-torture-in-jail/articleshow/136031053.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-complaint-in-tihar-nia-chief-rejects-us-citizen-vandykes-claim-of-torture-in-jail/articleshow/136031053.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T20:37:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136031505,imgsize-37086.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Compromised' PM remark: BJP hits back at Rahul Gandhi with AI image of LoP serving water to Trump]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/compromised-pm-remark-bjp-hits-back-at-rahul-gandhi-with-ai-image-of-lop-serving-water-to-trump/articleshow/136029752.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136029752.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Amidst the backdrop of political tensions, BJP spokesperson Gaurav Bhatia fired back at Rahul Gandhi's criticisms about India's lack of representation at the SCO summit with an AI-generated image. Gandhi's remarks targeted Prime Minister Modi's absence, leading BJP officials to highlight India's proactive engagement in international gatherings like BRICS and G20, while scrutinizing the previous Congress-led government's foreign relations strategy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/compromised-pm-remark-bjp-hits-back-at-rahul-gandhi-with-ai-image-of-lop-serving-water-to-trump/articleshow/136029752.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/compromised-pm-remark-bjp-hits-back-at-rahul-gandhi-with-ai-image-of-lop-serving-water-to-trump/articleshow/136029752.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T20:30:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136031324,imgsize-152120.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Partnership will define 21st century': US ambassador Sergio Gor]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/partnership-will-define-21st-century-us-ambassador-sergio-gor/articleshow/136030995.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136030995.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During his recent visit to the USS George Washington, US Ambassador Sergio Gor emphasized the crucial defense partnership between India and the US, predicting it will shape the 21st century for both nations. Highlighting President Donald Trump's commitment, Gor pointed to advancements in technology access and military training for India, alongside joint military exercises that showcase increasing interoperability and strategic ties.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/partnership-will-define-21st-century-us-ambassador-sergio-gor/articleshow/136030995.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/partnership-will-define-21st-century-us-ambassador-sergio-gor/articleshow/136030995.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T20:20:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136031045,imgsize-54840.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rajasthan panchayat election results 2026: 5 takeaways as Congress beats BJP; RLP makes big gains]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rajasthan-panchayat-election-results-2026-5-takeaways-as-congress-beats-bjp-rlp-makes-big-gains/articleshow/136030091.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136030091.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In the 2026 Rajasthan panchayat elections, Congress emerged victorious, securing thousands of seats and highlighting its political strength. The BJP, on the other hand, faced significant setbacks in key regions, raising questions about its grassroots appeal. Additionally, the Rashtriya Loktantrik Party's gains signify a shifting political landscape, while independent candidates' wins hint at emerging local dynamics. Overall, the results pose serious challenges for the BJP as assembly elections approach.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rajasthan-panchayat-election-results-2026-5-takeaways-as-congress-beats-bjp-rlp-makes-big-gains/articleshow/136030091.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rajasthan-panchayat-election-results-2026-5-takeaways-as-congress-beats-bjp-rlp-makes-big-gains/articleshow/136030091.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T19:52:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pallavi</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136030376,imgsize-65294.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Will put him out of circulation': NIA chief welcomes Canada naming Goldy Brar most-wanted criminal]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-put-him-out-of-circulation-nia-chief-welcomes-canada-naming-goldy-brar-most-wanted-criminal/articleshow/136030092.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136030092.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Canadian government has put a $250,000 bounty on gangster Satinderjeet Singh, known as Goldy Brar, who is wanted for first-degree murder connected to a recent homicide in Winnipeg. Brar, who is also on the FBI's Top 10 Most Wanted list with a whopping $1 million reward, poses a serious threat as he is armed and dangerous. His capture would significantly aid ongoing investigations into organized crime activities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-put-him-out-of-circulation-nia-chief-welcomes-canada-naming-goldy-brar-most-wanted-criminal/articleshow/136030092.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-put-him-out-of-circulation-nia-chief-welcomes-canada-naming-goldy-brar-most-wanted-criminal/articleshow/136030092.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T19:45:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136030263,imgsize-694603.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Need to treasure those': SC refers 135-year-old library relocation case to CJI; no shifting of books for now]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/need-to-treasure-those-sc-refers-135-year-old-library-relocation-case-to-cji-no-shifting-of-books-for-now/articleshow/136029550.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136029550.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/need-to-treasure-those-sc-refers-135-year-old-library-relocation-case-to-cji-no-shifting-of-books-for-now/articleshow/136029550.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/need-to-treasure-those-sc-refers-135-year-old-library-relocation-case-to-cji-no-shifting-of-books-for-now/articleshow/136029550.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T19:36:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136029992,imgsize-107350.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Dialogue on civilisation, not war’: PM Modi's message at SCO summit - top quotes]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dialogue-on-civilisation-not-war-pm-modis-message-at-sco-summit-top-quotes/articleshow/136029829.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136029829.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dialogue-on-civilisation-not-war-pm-modis-message-at-sco-summit-top-quotes/articleshow/136029829.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dialogue-on-civilisation-not-war-pm-modis-message-at-sco-summit-top-quotes/articleshow/136029829.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T19:30:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aadrita Halder</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136029927,imgsize-913362.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India unveils first indigenous H5N1 vaccine to protect chickens from bird flu]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-unveils-first-indigenous-h5n1-vaccine-to-protect-chickens-from-bird-flu/articleshow/136029379.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136029379.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-unveils-first-indigenous-h5n1-vaccine-to-protect-chickens-from-bird-flu/articleshow/136029379.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-unveils-first-indigenous-h5n1-vaccine-to-protect-chickens-from-bird-flu/articleshow/136029379.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T19:18:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136029561,imgsize-16202.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Owaisi-Azad alliance looks strong on paper, but Akhilesh Yadav has little to fear: 5 reasons why SP may not be worried]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/owaisi-azad-alliance-looks-strong-on-paper-but-akhilesh-yadav-has-little-to-fear-5-reasons-why-sp-may-not-be-worried/articleshow/136026368.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136026368.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Owaisi-Chandrashekhar Azad alliance may look like a major threat to Akhilesh Yadav's PDA formula, but the reality in Uttar Pradesh tells a different story. From Akhilesh's efforts to broaden the SP's support base to Azad's challenge from Mayawati and Owaisi's limited success in UP, we examine five reasons why the new Dalit-Muslim alliance may not be as big a worry for the SP chief as it appears.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/owaisi-azad-alliance-looks-strong-on-paper-but-akhilesh-yadav-has-little-to-fear-5-reasons-why-sp-may-not-be-worried/articleshow/136026368.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/owaisi-azad-alliance-looks-strong-on-paper-but-akhilesh-yadav-has-little-to-fear-5-reasons-why-sp-may-not-be-worried/articleshow/136026368.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T18:41:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136028517,imgsize-215074.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening Newswrap: Congress hits back at PM Modi's 'hunger' jibe; NCB busts US-bound opioid pipeline &amp; more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-congress-hits-back-at-pm-modis-hunger-jibe-ncb-busts-us-bound-opioid-pipeline-more/articleshow/136026967.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136026967.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-congress-hits-back-at-pm-modis-hunger-jibe-ncb-busts-us-bound-opioid-pipeline-more/articleshow/136026967.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-congress-hits-back-at-pm-modis-hunger-jibe-ncb-busts-us-bound-opioid-pipeline-more/articleshow/136026967.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T18:35:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136028286,imgsize-55628.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Another Parliament showdown loading over delimitation bill? Congress says INDIA bloc, including DMK, NCP-SP, united]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/another-parliament-showdown-loading-over-delimitation-bill-congress-says-india-bloc-including-dmk-ncp-sp-united/articleshow/136027591.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136027591.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Congress party is voicing concerns about the government's insufficient communication about the upcoming